              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aboolela babemeelesi be chikholo che Baisiraeli ali, “Kano niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.23.21+DEU.23.22+DEU.23.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 23.21-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 5.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omundu ne echuba khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi namwe ne echuba khulwe ndakaano, se akhoyeele afunaka khu khwechuba khwewe tawe. Akhoyele akhole buli sisiindu nisio echuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi omuele osiimenya mungo mwa raraawe ne echuba khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala ne echuba khulwe endakaano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akhoya akhole buli sisiindu nisio alaka namwe echuba. Akhoya akhola niko alaka aaba bali raraawe aulila niko echuba mala se amukaania tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali raraawe amukhiingilila khukhwichusia endakaano yewe khu ndaalo niyo aulila aba omukhasi oyo se enyibwa khukibiikha tawe. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alimubeela, sikila raraawe amukhiingilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne aaba omukhasi oyo ne alabeela ne asiili asi we endakaano, namwe aba ne ali asi we endakaano eye kamakhuwa niko aloma ne akhebaasia tawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akhoya akhole buli sisiindu nisio alaka namwe echuba. Akhabikhe khukhwechuba khwewe aaba bali omuseecha wewe aulila mala se amukhiingilila tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omuseecha wewe amukhiingilila khukhwichusia endakaano, khu ndaalo niyo akiulila omukhasi oyo ne echuba se akhoyeele wakibiikha tawe. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alimubeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namulekhwa namwe omukhasi owalekhana ne omuseecha akhoya eechusie buli endakaano niyo akhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi oli ne omuseecha aaba ne akhola endakaano namwe echuba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akhoya akhola buli sisiindu nisio alaka namwe echuba. Akhoya akhola ario aaba bali omuseecha wewe aulila mala se amukhiingilila tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali omuseecha wewe aaba ne aulila mala amukhiingilila, se akhoyeele echusia khukhwechuba tawe. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alimubeela, sikila omuseecha wewe amukhiingilile khukhwichusia endakaano yewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuseecha wewe ali ne bunyali khufukiilila namwe khuloba endakaano yosi yosi namwe khukhwechuba khwosi khwosi nikhwo akholile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omuseecha wewe aaba ne akhalomakho liosi liosi buli endaalo tawe aba afukiilile khukhwechuba khwo omukhasi khwoosi ne ndakaano yewe yoosi niyo akhola. Aba afukiilile aaba ne akhalomakho liosi liosi tawe khukhwama khu ndaalo niyo aulilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne aaba ne akelao aloba endakaano, enyuma we siise khuulila, aba alanyoola bumayaanu bukhoyeele bwecha khu mukhasi wewe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
